        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I didn't manage to find a real world LSP server that I could easily set up *and* reproduce it returning `completionItem.command`. But let's hope that its support straightforward enough to not introduce any serious issues.\r\n\r\nThis should now be resolved on the `main` branch. @neo451, could you please test and see if it works as you'd expect?",
